# Buyer Order Tracking Module Implementation Plan

This document details the architectural strategy for the Buyer Order Tracking Module. This module gives buyers full visibility over their purchases, visualizing the workflow from Escrow lock through delivery, complete with simulated map layouts and blockchain verification.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Live Tracking & WebSockets:** For this sandbox demonstration, implementing real WebSocket infrastructure in the Rust Axum backend introduces significant complexity. Instead, I will implement **React Query polling** (fetching every 5 seconds) to simulate real-time updates seamlessly without requiring page refreshes.
> **Delivery Map:** We will use a mock map UI (a visually appealing static placeholder) to represent the delivery route, as integrating live Google Maps requires valid API billing keys.

