## Verification Plan
1. Ensure the Rust backend is updated and running.
2. In the buyer dashboard, navigate to **Orders**.
3. Verify that the previously created order is listed correctly.
4. Click on the order to open the **Order Tracking** view.
5. In a separate browser tab, log in as the Farmer and accept/pack/ship the order.
6. Verify that the Buyer Tracking view updates in near real-time (via polling) and animates the progress bar accordingly.
